# Frontend Patterns

## Structure
- Pages in `frontend/src/pages/`
- Components in `frontend/src/components/`
- Auth in `frontend/src/contexts/AuthContext.jsx`
- API client in `frontend/src/services/api.js`

## Auth Flow
- JWT stored in localStorage after login
- Axios interceptor adds `Authorization: Bearer <token>` to requests
- ProtectedRoute wraps pages requiring auth
- UI elements should reflect RBAC and subscription limits where appropriate

## API Client
- Base URL is proxied via Vite in development (`/api`)
- Centralized Axios instance in `api.js`
- Handles 401 (redirect to login) and 403 (show access denied)

## UI Conventions
- Adapt baseline design patterns from `Kliklak_Dashboard` reference (Account, Users, Orders sections)
- Use modal dialogs for critical actions/errors
- Loading spinners during API calls
- Data views (like Orders and Fiscal Bills) should clearly present related status details and action bars
